{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "737b0e94-2735-86d5-89c1-89a1450e9498",
  "created_at": "2025-12-18T12:48:38-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Nancy Peckham",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T12:46:34-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T12:46:38-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Lorraine. Yes, my name is Nancy Peckham. Let me explain what's going on. I'm at 76 Rhode Island Avenue, up on the Hill, and my trash was not picked up this week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T12:46:50-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 76 Rhode Island Avenue. Was it your regular day that got missed?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T12:46:55-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. I put the barrel out Wednesday night like always, and with the rain coming in all day Wednesday I made sure the lid was on tight. This morning it's still sitting there, full. And this is the second miss in a row. Last week they skipped us too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T12:47:12-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Second one in a row, okay. I'm sorry about that. I'll put in a report for a missed pickup at 76 Rhode Island. Did anything block the barrel, like a parked car or a snowbank?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T12:47:24-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, nothing. It's right at the curb where it always is. Sorry, I've got you on speakerphone, I'm clipping coupons from the Sunday paper and I need both hands. Can you hear me all right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T12:47:36-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you fine. So the barrel was at the curb, nothing in the way. I'll send that to the crew supervisor and ask that they come back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T12:47:46-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. And while I have you, I also have an old appliance. It's a dishwasher that the landlord replaced. It's in the basement hallway. How do I get rid of that? Do they just take it with the regular trash?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T12:48:00-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Usually large items like appliances aren't taken with the regular trash. There's normally a separate bulk pickup you have to schedule, or you can bring it to the drop-off. Let me transfer you to the right desk, or I can take your number and have someone call you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T12:48:16-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let's do the call back. It's 401-555-0178."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T12:48:19-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-seven-eight. And it's Nancy Peckham, correct?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T12:48:23-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Correct. Peckham, P-E-C-K-H-A-M."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T12:48:25-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. I'll have someone reach out about the dishwasher, and the missed pickup goes in today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T12:48:32-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right. Thank you, Lorraine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T12:48:35-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Have a good afternoon."
    }
  ],
